graph LR
    MustGather["must-gather<br/>Diagnostic Collector"]

    %% External Dependencies (build/runtime tools)
    MustGather -->|"base image<br/>(Konflux)"| OSEMustGather["ose-must-gather-rhel9<br/>v4.20"]
    MustGather -->|"base image<br/>(upstream)"| OriginMustGather["origin-must-gather<br/>4.21.0"]
