    MustGather -->|"CRD read"| InferExt["Gateway API<br/>Inference Extension<br/>InferencePool"]
    MustGather -->|"CRD read"| NIM["NIM Account"]

    %% All reads go through K8s API
    K8sAPI["Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS"]

    RHODSOp -.->|via| K8sAPI
    KServe -.->|via| K8sAPI
    DSP -.->|via| K8sAPI

